5,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Since our current habit isn't working, we need a sustainable plan. I'll look into the stopwatch timing of a full pass and what each housemate counts as done to get some clear facts.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I think it's wise to start with data. I'll examine the absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use to see how the actual burden is distributed.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know why the rooms get messy! I'll check the bathroom grout after the July scrub and the rows recorded in the house chat to see what's happening.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I'll look into the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, as well as the management office rate sheet and billing, just to see how we're managing our supplies.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I believe the human element is most important here. I will look into the note left by the previous tenants and the standard terms of the outside firm.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Does anyone else feel we should look into the house chat? Sakura is doing it, but I wonder if we need more perspectives on those disagreements to understand the friction.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I believe Sakura's findings will suffice for now. I'm more interested in whether the usage patterns align with our current efforts, which is why I'm focusing on the kitchen and calendar.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I can share everything I find! I'm just curious if the fights are always about the same things, or if it's just because the bathroom is scary.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is very kind of you to offer, Sakura. I think it is important that we all remain gentle with one another while we figure this out.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, Shizue. Harmony is the foundation of a home. I hope the previous tenants' notes provide a cautionary tale that helps us avoid similar pitfalls in our own journey.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,"I agree. Since we have our lists, let's proceed to the research phase so we can make a decision based on evidence rather than assumptions.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. I shall begin my observations immediately to ensure we have a concrete basis for our discussion in the next round.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I'm going to be a detective and find out all the secrets of the grout and the chat!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will do my part as well. I hope the information I find helps us create a system that is fair and easy for everyone to follow.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I shall do the same. Let us all approach this with an open heart and a patient mind, for the process is as important as the result.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,I think we have a solid plan. Let's all gather our findings and reconvene to discuss the options for the coming year.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. I look forward to seeing how our individual findings intersect to reveal the true nature of our domestic challenges.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm ready! I'll be the best detective ever and find all the clues!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will be waiting for you all with a smile. Let us hope our findings lead us to a peaceful arrangement.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"Until then, let us maintain our kindness. I shall see you all soon with the wisdom I have gathered.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
