60,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The options are a Fixed Weekly Rota, a Paid Cleaning Service, or Standing Assignments. Given the time commitment and inconsistent standards, a professional service seems the most objective.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I must disagree; a paid service still requires us to tidy beforehand, and it doesn't address the imbalance of usage. A Fixed Weekly Rota would at least be logically transparent.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,I don't like the Standing Assignments if it makes people stop talking to each other like the old tenants! I think a professional cleaner sounds like magic!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"A professional service sounds lovely, but I worry about the cost and how we would handle the billing so that no one is left out of pocket.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"I share Shizue's concern for the financial harmony, but I fear Standing Assignments most of all. Let us avoid the path that led the previous tenants to silence.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shizue, we could set up a shared fund or a strict monthly deadline for the invoice to ensure the billing is fair and transparent for everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, while a fund solves the payment, it doesn't solve the usage. A Fixed Weekly Rota is the only option that ensures everyone, regardless of their habits, contributes an equal amount of labor.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"But a rota is just more reminding! If we have a professional cleaner, we won't have to fight about who forgot the bathroom or why the grout is black again!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very good point, Sakura. If a professional handles the difficult parts, we can spend our time being kind to one another instead of worrying about the scrubbing.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"I agree with Sakura and Shizue. If we remove the source of the friction, we protect our bonds. A professional service seems the most likely to keep our hearts light and our home peaceful.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, while a rota is transparent, it doesn't solve the problem of varying standards of ""done."" A professional service guarantees a consistent result, which removes the primary cause of our arguments.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I see your point, but we must consider the cost. If we pay for a service, we are simply trading labor for money, which may create a different kind of financial resentment.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,But money is easier than fighting! I'd rather pay a little bit than have to look at the scary bathroom or argue in the chat!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Sakura. If we are clear about the monthly cost from the start, I believe we can manage the payments without any trouble or hard feelings.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have found a common ground. By investing a small amount of our resources, we are investing in the longevity of our friendship and the peace of our shared sanctuary.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Minako,,I believe the evidence points toward the Paid Cleaning Service as the most sustainable choice for our household's harmony and standards. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"While I still have reservations about the usage imbalance, the consensus on social harmony is compelling. I will prioritize the peace of the house. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I want the magic cleaner! I vote for Option B!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree that peace and kindness are the most important things. I vote for Option B.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,"For the sake of our friendship and the tranquility of our home, I join you all. I vote for Option B.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
